      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E6R3 GL:Institutional Review Board (IRB)/Independent Ethics Committee (IEC) (p. printed 87 / PDF 95); EUCTR Art. 2(2)(11) (p. OJ L 158/12); 21CFR56 21CFR56.108(b)(2) (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination)</bpmn:documentation>
