      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: 21CFR312 21CFR312.56(b) (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination)
Requirements: REQ-148
Binding: binding-law
Jurisdiction: US
Party: sponsor</bpmn:documentation>
