    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="L3_TA1">
      <bpmn:text>Reading convention: the steps from 'Identify protocol deviations' to 'Remediate deviations and noncompliance' recur throughout trial conduct. The sequence shows the path of one deviation; the AND gateways show channels that are open in parallel. No loop markers are used.</bpmn:text>
