  <bpmn:process id="L4_01_P_SPON_PROCESS" name="Sponsor" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">SCP-03: 16 activities (target 5-15) - 34 REQs and the separations required by C-02 (separately sourced CtQ-risk-criteria chain) and C-04 (acceptable ranges vs protocol flexibility); 24 nodes, within 31.
C-02: the CtQ-to-iPD link (REQ-013, with REQ-012) is a separate task A7 that rests only on draft FDA guidance and best practice; the ICH criteria task A6 carries only E6R3 A1-3.9.3 and E3QA S3.
Interface 'Quality by design and protocol development' (upstream, D3): its output is start event S1, which carries the interface REQs (no placeholder can precede a start event).</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="L4_01_P_SPON_LANESET">
