    <bpmn:startEvent id="L4_01_S1" name="CtQ factors identified">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E8R1 S6.1.1 (p. printed 18); E6R3 P6.2 (p. printed 5 / PDF 13); E6R3 A1-3.1.2 (p. printed 23 / PDF 31); E6R3 A1-3.10 (p. printed 27 / PDF 35); E8R1 S3 (p. printed 3); E8R1 S3.1 (p. printed 3); E8R1 S3.2 (p. printed 4; printed 5); E8R1 S3.3.5 (p. printed 6); E8R1 S7 (p. printed 20-21; printed 20; bullet 1 of 18; printed 20; bullet 2 of 18; printed 20; bullet 3 of 18; printed 20; bullet 4 of 18; printed 20; bullet 5 of 18; printed 20; bullet 6 of 18; printed 20; bullet 8 of 18; printed 20; bullet 9 of 18; printed 20; bullet 10 of 18; printed 20; bullet 11 of 18; printed 20; bullet 12 of 18; printed 20; bullet 13 of 18; printed 20; bullet 14 of 18; printed 20; bullet 15 of 18; printed 20; bullet 16 of 18; printed 20; bullet 17 of 18; printed 20; bullet 18 of 18); E6R3 P7.1 (p. printed 5 / PDF 13); E6R3 P7.4 (p. printed 5-6 / PDF 13-14); E6R3 P8.3 (p. printed 6 / PDF 14); E6R3 A1-3.1.4 (p. printed 23 / PDF 31); E6R3 A2-3.2.2 (p. printed 57 / PDF 65); E8R1 S3.3 (p. printed 5); E8R1 S3.3.1 (p. printed 5); E8R1 S3.3.2 (p. printed 5); E8R1 S3.3.4 (p. printed 6); E8R1 S3.3.3 (p. printed 6); M11 S2.1 (p. printed 2); M11-TEMPLATE SConventions [verify] (p. printed iv-vii); FDA-PD24 SIII.B.2 (p. printed 8; lines 295-298); TCB-RBQM SHow-QTLs-Fit-in-a-Quality-Management-System (p. journal pp. 251-261 (section page not confirmed)); CTTI-QbD S2 (p. 1 of 2); CTTI-QbD S3 (p. 1-2 of 2)
