Binding: binding-ICH
Jurisdiction: ICH, US
Deadline: during study planning
Party: sponsor; The sponsor and other parties designing quality into a clinical study; clinical investigators, study coordinators and other site staff, and patients/patient organisations
Verify: [verify] carried by the A1 start event 'CtQ factors identified' (no separate task); closest ICH text to a CtQ-to-iPD link (C-02); [verify binding] EU/US adoption of E8R1 not checked by the research stems (C-06); [verify] sentence content from a single fetch (F02) (R2-005); [verify] sentence content from a single fetch (F02) (R2-006); [verify] sentence content from a single fetch (F03) (R2-014); [verify] sentence content from a single fetch (F03) (R2-017); [verify] detail from web page fetch only (R5-057); [verify binding] EU/US adoption of M11, M11-TEMPLATE not checked by the research stems (C-06); [verify] section content from a single fetch (F30); Step 4 status confirmed in F26 (R2-111); [verify] section label of the conventions part and wording; single fetch (F31) (R2-112)</bpmn:documentation>
