    <bpmn:task id="L4_01_A15" name="Train study personnel">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E8R1 S6.1.2 (p. printed 18); E8R1 S7 (p. printed 20; bullet 7 of 18); FDA-PD24 SIII.B.2 (p. printed 6; lines 225-227; printed 9; lines 311-314); TCB-PD-TIRS STrain (p. journal pp. 733-742 (section page not confirmed; PMC HTML read))
