        <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E6R3 A1-3.11.4.5.1(a) (p. printed 32 / PDF 40); E6R3 A1-3.11.4.4 (p. printed 32 / PDF 40)</bpmn:documentation>
