Binding: binding-ICH
Jurisdiction: ICH, US
Deadline: timely (REQ-036); early (REQ-041)
Record: centralised monitoring report; deviation listings; oversight / monitoring plan
Party: sponsor; CRAs; site monitors and centralized monitoring
Draft: DRAFT guidance
Verify: [verify] gerund item under A1-3.11.4.5; actor not named (R1 C7); [verify binding] EU/US adoption of E8R1 not checked by the research stems (C-06); [verify] R1-089 is Annex 2: effective in the EU from 15 Jan 2027; FDA Annex 2 guidance still draft (C-06); [verify] basis is draft guidance only - shown as DRAFT, never a binding step</bpmn:documentation>
