  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="L4_03_P_SPON_PROCESS" name="Sponsor" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">A4 'Handle urgent safety measures' is the interface call activity of C-08 (decided by user 06 Nov 2026; calls null, interface true, S0-18).
Sponsor ends state what the sponsor reaches: E1 'Immediate hazard addressed', E2 'Deviation request approved', E3 'Deviation request rejected'. The l3_cut outcomes 'Immediate-hazard deviation implemented and reported' and 'Intentional deviation approved and implemented' are the investigator ends E4 and E5.
The investigator process has one trigger, the l3_cut event 'Intentional protocol deviation considered'; task A8 decides whether the immediate-hazard exception applies (FLW-05), marked [verify] because no source names it as a separate step. Two blank start events were avoided (bpmnlint single-blank-start-event).
C-09: G4 'Deviation from eligibility criteria requested?' leads to the rejection task A6 (M11 S5.1); the FDA-PD24 example stays DRAFT on the request flow (REQ-074).</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="L4_03_P_SPON_LANESET">
      <bpmn:lane id="L4_03_L_SPON" name="Sponsor">
        <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E6R3 GL:Sponsor (p. printed 90 / PDF 98); EUCTR Art. 2(2)(14) (p. OJ L 158/12); 21CFR312 21CFR312.50 (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:extensionElements>
          <ipd:trace>
            <ipd:source key="E6R3" loc="GL:Sponsor" page="printed 90 / PDF 98"/>
            <ipd:source key="EUCTR" loc="Art. 2(2)(14)" page="OJ L 158/12"/>
            <ipd:source key="21CFR312" loc="21CFR312.50" page="n/a - eCFR web text without pagination"/>
          </ipd:trace>
        </bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_S1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_G1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_A1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_A2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_G9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_A3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_G10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_G2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_A4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_A5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_G3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_E1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_G4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_A6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_A7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_G5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_G6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>L4_03_E2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
