    <bpmn:task id="L4_04_A1" name="Confirm event is a protocol deviation">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E3QA S3 (p. printed 6); FDA-PD24 SII (p. printed 1-2; lines 17-19 and 57-63; printed 2-3; lines 76-86); FDA-PD24 SIII.B.2 (p. printed 7; line 233); FDA-PD24 SIII.A (p. printed 3; lines 93-101); TCB-PD-TIRS SDefine (p. journal pp. 733-742 (section page not confirmed; PMC HTML read)); TCB-PD-TIRS SGCP-Compliance (p. journal pp. 733-742 (section page not confirmed; PMC HTML read))
