          <ipd:verify>[verify] E6(R3) does not state whether a protocol deviation counts as such a 'change' (C-03)</ipd:verify>
          <ipd:verify>[verify] duty may lie with investigator or sponsor (A1-2.4.6)</ipd:verify>
        </ipd:trace>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:messageFlow>
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="L4_05_M6" name="Change in research activity reported" sourceRef="L4_05_A9" targetRef="L4_05_P_IEC">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: 21CFR312 21CFR312.66 (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination); 21CFR312 21CFR312.53(c)(1)(vii) (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination)
Requirements: REQ-121
Binding: binding-law
Jurisdiction: US
Deadline: promptly (no day count)
Party: investigator
Verify: [verify] 21 CFR does not state whether a protocol deviation is a 'change in the research activity'; IRB written procedures decide (C-03)</bpmn:documentation>
