          <ipd:verify>[verify] basis is draft guidance only - shown as DRAFT, never a binding step</ipd:verify>
        </ipd:trace>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:messageFlow>
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="L4_05_M8" name="Serious or continuing noncompliance reported" sourceRef="L4_05_P_IEC" targetRef="L4_05_P_RA">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: 21CFR56 21CFR56.108(b)(2) (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination)
Requirements: REQ-124
Binding: binding-law
Jurisdiction: US
Deadline: prompt (no day count)
Party: each IRB
Verify: [verify] represented by message flows from the collapsed IRB/IEC pool to the Regulatory authority and Investigator/institution pools (D1); [verify] 21 CFR defines neither 'serious' nor 'continuing'; no source maps iPD to this trigger (C-01)</bpmn:documentation>
