      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: EMA-SB S3.2 (p. printed 5-6/21); CTIS-BT-SB24 SSlide-19 (p. slides 19, 26); CTIS-TM05 SOther-notifications [verify] (p. printed 4)
