  <bpmn:process id="L4_06_P_SPON_PROCESS" name="Sponsor" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">C-10: the binding US either-or duty (REQ-135, 21 CFR 312.56(b)) sits on A3 'Secure compliance' (before the ICH 'consider termination' decision A8) and on A10, instead of a separate US branch, to keep the model within 31 nodes; its 'end participation' alternative is the termination path G6-G7-A10-E2.
C-15: root cause analysis in the Sponsor lane (REQ-136, REQ-138); the investigator's own preventive measures are task A14 (REQ-133).
Monitor lane for A2 per C-25 (E6R3 A1-3.11.4.5.1 gerund items).</bpmn:documentation>
