  <bpmn:process id="L4_07_P_SPON_PROCESS" name="Sponsor" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">A4 'Handle statistical analysis and estimands' and A13 'Handle CSR and study data submission' are interface call activities (calls null, interface true, S0-18).
Investigator/institution is a collapsed pool here (orchestrator decision 06 Nov 2026): collapsed where it carries no tasks; D1 intent - investigator duties visible as tasks - unaffected.
Sequence follows ICH E9 S5.2 and S7.1: deviation handling and analysis set decisions in the blind review (A2, A3) before unblinding and analysis (A4), impact characterisation after it (A5).
Jurisdiction pattern: two independent XOR pairs in sequence (EU G1-G2, US G3-G4), so a trial under both regimes passes both branches.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="L4_07_P_SPON_LANESET">
