    <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Request-driven hand-off 'Archived records made available on request' (EU CTR Art. 58; E6R3 AppC-C.2.6) is shown as data stores D1 'Trial master file' and D2 'Investigator site file' (glossary terms) with sources instead of a message flow, as l3_cut allows; REQ-192 and REQ-196 are on tasks A3 and A4.
Investigator jurisdiction groups: A7 is in GR_EU2 and A8 in GR_US (separate group ids because a group must cover adjacent members only).
C-23: US sponsor retention under 21 CFR 312.57 was not extracted; listed in open_items.</bpmn:documentation>
