    <bpmn:task id="L4_08_A1" name="Archive important and non-important deviations">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E6R3 AppC-C.3.2 (p. printed 81 / PDF 89; printed 78-79 / PDF 86-87); E6R3 AppC-C.3.1(r) (p. printed 78 / PDF 86); E6R3 GL:Essential Records (p. printed 85-86 / PDF 93-94); TCB-PD-TIRS SClose-Out (p. journal pp. 733-742 (section page not confirmed; PMC HTML read)); TCB-PD-TIRS SStore (p. journal pp. 733-742 (section page not confirmed; PMC HTML read))
