      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E6R3 AppC-C.2.3 (p. printed 75 / PDF 83); E6R3 AppC-C.2.6 (p. printed 76 / PDF 84); EUCTR Art. 58 (p. OJ L 158/41)
Verify: [verify] directly accessible on request by regulatory authorities (E6R3 AppC-C.2.6; EU CTR Art. 58); request-driven hand-off shown as data store, not as message flow</bpmn:documentation>
